<div id="session-message-wrapper">
	
</div> <blockquote>
<p>Electronic filing in Iowa court cases and appeals is mandatory unless otherwise required or authorized. All filers, including attorneys, self-represented persons, and government agencies are required to file documents electronically in court. You may register to file electronically at <a href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.iowacourts.state.ia.us%2FEfile%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CSteve.Davis%40iowacourts.gov%7Ce24e4253da954ee4c70f08dd9d57e35d%7Cb889a26811e540a39d38776a1eec5c26%7C0%7C0%7C638839722979111854%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C4000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=h6ARgsqNF7CIQeePW76hktHoRYAK9jjc7jWlwSeO86I%3D&amp;reserved=0">https://www.iowacourts.state.ia.us/Efile/</a>. There is no fee to register.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>Use the latest version of Acrobat Reader to fill PDF forms. <a href="https://get.adobe.com/reader/">Get Acrobat&nbsp;free here</a>.&nbsp; Instructions for&nbsp;writing&nbsp;on a form that is not fillable and savable are&nbsp;<a href="/static/media/cms/PDFFillFormsAcrobatReaderDC_E766774940186.pdf">here</a>.</p>

<h3>Instructions for Electronically Signing Court Forms</h3>

<ul>
	<li>
	<p><a href="/static/media/cms/Acrobat_Reader_DC_Signatures_641C7E314AC2C.pdf">Using Acrobat Reader DC on your computer</a></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p><a href="/static/media/cms/Foxit_Reader_Signatures_E14CD136393BC.pdf">Using Foxit Reader on a public access computer</a></p>
	</li>
</ul>

<h3>Iowa Interactive Court Forms</h3>

<p>Free, easy-to-use program for preparing certain forms for domestic abuse, elder abuse, child support modifications, fee waivers, name changes, small claims, and divorce with no minor or dependent adult children cases (divorcio sin hijos): <a href="/for-the-public/representing-yourself/iowa-interactive-court-forms/">Iowa Interactive Court Forms</a></p>

<p>Pursuant to Iowa Rule of Electronic Procedure 16.201(35), court forms may be signed electronically with a digitized signature.</p>

<blockquote>
<p><img alt="" height="119" src="/media/cms/Court_Navigator_logo_2_copy_9A9FBE12D0CFD.jpg" style="float:left; margin:0px 12px" width="100" /></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><a href="/iowa-courts/court-navigator/">Schedule a Court Navigator</a> for assistance with court forms and basic information for representing yourself in a civil case.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</blockquote>

<h1>Court Forms</h1> 

	<div id="fancytree" data-source="ajax" class="collection collection--all-files ">

		
		
		
	</div>

	
		<script type="e98a3f26c0adb49d2589802c-text/javascript">
			$.ajax({
				type: 'POST',
				url: '/for-the-public/court-forms/list',
				data: {},
				success: function( data ) {
					var treeData = data;
					jQuery( "#fancytree" ).fancytree({
						selectMode: 1,
						source: treeData,
						expand: function( event, data ) {
							data.node.renderTitle();
						},
						collapse: function( event, data ) {
							data.node.renderTitle();
						},
						icon: function( event, data ) {
							if( data.node.isFolder() && data.node.expanded == true ) {
								return data.node.data.iconOpen;
							}
							else if( !data.node.isFolder() ){
								return '';
							}
						},
						lazyLoad: function( event, data ){
							var node = data.node;
							data.result = {
								type: 'POST',
								url: "/for-the-public/court-forms/list",
								data: {
									category: node.key
								},
								cache: false
							};
						},
						keyboard: false,
						titlesTabbable: false,
						clickFolderMode: 2
					});
				}
			});
		</script>
	
